# C-- Data Extraction and Parsing Utility

This tool implements a production-grade data extraction and parsing utility
strictly using the C-- language. It provides deterministic, high-precision
workflow for defining and parsing complex unstructured datasets, ensuring
strict type-level consistency across all extracted schemas.

## Features
- Deterministic parsing of unstructured datasets.
- Strict type-level consistency checks for all extracted schemas.
- Conflicting data format resolution.
- Auditable extraction logs.
- Structured data mapping for downstream analytics pipelines.
- Robust extraction registry with error handling and transactional rollback.
- Machine-readable parsing verdicts.

## Usage
1. Place your input data files in the `./input` directory.
2. Place your schema definition files in the `./schemas` directory.
3. Run `main.c--`.
4. Check the `./output` directory for the parsed results and logs.
